# Cross-origin isolation enables SharedArrayBuffer, which ONNX Runtime Web uses
# for multi-threaded WASM inference during background removal. WebGPU works
# without these headers; they are a progressive enhancement.
#
# This file uses the Netlify / Cloudflare Pages headers format. For other hosts
# set the equivalent response headers (see SvelteKit adapter docs).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
